# Nothing here is needed to build the site, and the first entry must never
# leave this machine: `source/` is the third-party course this one adapts.
# The deploy is a build from `build/src`, the tracked PDFs in `dist/` and the
# cover page in `web/`, so excluding these costs nothing.
source/
.venv/
.claude/
shots/
pages/
site/
textclash.json
*.tmp

# Instructor material is not published.
dist/Instructor_Solutions.*

# The pin for the numerical suite in verify/, which does not run on the host.
# Left there it makes the platform read the project as a Python application
# and the deploy fails looking for an entrypoint.
requirements.txt
